# The sizing game's solver is ProcessPro's engine, published to GitHub Packages
# as @jacob12244/proc-engine. NPM_TOKEN is a GitHub personal access token with
# read:packages. To work on the engine and the game together, set PROC_SRC to a
# ProcessPro checkout instead and Vite reads the engine's source.
@jacob12244:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
